  </header>

  <Callout title="Medical storefront, not verified adult-use retail" type="warning">
    Hidden Greens describes its Buxton location as a medical cannabis dispensary. OCP's June 1, 2026 adult-use establishment file contains no Buxton application or license row. Do not treat this page, a menu, or the fact that adult possession is legal statewide as proof of an adult-use sale.
  </Callout>

